%% Simplified Follow Toggle Sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as Laravel API
  participant DB as DB
  U->>FE: Click Follow / Unfollow
  FE->>API: POST /api/Y/users/{id}/follow OR DELETE /api/Y/users/{id}/unfollow
  API->>DB: Check relation
  alt Create follow
    DB-->>API: none
    API->>DB: INSERT follow
    API-->>FE: { following: true }
  else Remove follow
    API->>DB: DELETE follow
    API-->>FE: { following: false }
  end
  FE->>U: Update button state
